# Keep all text files LF in the repo AND in the working tree on every platform,
# so line-ending-sensitive tooling behaves identically on Windows/Linux/macOS
# runners. Without this, Git checks out LF blobs as CRLF on Windows and
# `rustfmt --check` (newline_style = "Unix") rejects every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never apply text/EOL conversion.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.gif  binary
*.icns binary
*.exr  binary
